{{#invoke:Episode list|list|Title=From Water to Land"; alternate title: "Lungs, Legs & Eggs|OriginalAirDate={{Start date|1963|01|27}} |ProdCode=4 |ShortSummary=
:The story of how [[vertebrates]] transitioned from water to land. [[Paleontology|Palaeontologist]] [[Alfred Romer|Dr. Alfred S. Romer]] of [[Harvard University]] explains the evolution of lungs, legs, and a new kind of egg found in aquatic creatures.<ref>{{#invoke:cite|news|url=https://www.newspapers.com/newspage/42416711/ |title=CBOT Highlights |work=The Ottawa Journal |date=January 26, 1963 |page=3, The TV Journal |access-date=December 6, 2016 |archive-date=December 20, 2016 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20161220111241/https://www.newspapers.com/newspage/42416711/ |url-status=live }}</ref>}}

