:Series consultant [[Lister Sinclair]] pays tribute to Sir [[Isaac Newton]]. The program attempts to capture the spirit of the time through the words of Newton himself and those of his contemporaries.<ref>{{#invoke:cite|news|url=https://www.newspapers.com/newspage/44375099/ |title=CBOT Highlights |work=The Ottawa Journal |date=April 6, 1963 |page=3, The TV Journal |access-date=December 7, 2016 |archive-date=December 20, 2016 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20161220105558/https://www.newspapers.com/newspage/44375099/ |url-status=live }}</ref>}}

