{{#invoke:Episode list|list|Title=The Heimaey Eruption: Iceland 1973 |OriginalAirDate= {{Start date|1974|10|30}} |ProdCode=03 |ShortSummary=
:A film on the volcanic eruption off the south coast of Iceland in 1973.<ref>{{#invoke:cite|news|last=Peacock |first=Bruce |url=https://news.google.com/newspapers?id=kQNVAAAAIBAJ&pg=3314%2C2768809 |title=Tube Talk |work=The Leader-Post |location=Regina, Saskatchewan |date=October 25, 1974 |page=3, PostScript section |access-date=October 5, 2020 |archive-date=October 23, 2023 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231023123651/https://news.google.com/newspapers?id=kQNVAAAAIBAJ&pg=3314,2768809 |url-status=live }}</ref><ref>{{cite journal |title=The Eldfell Eruption, Heimaey, Iceland: A 25-Year Retrospective |journal=Geoscience Canada |date=March 2000 |last=Morgan |first=Alan V. |volume=27 |issue=1 |page=1 |format=PDF |issn=1911-4850 |url=https://journals.lib.unb.ca/index.php/GC/article/viewFile/4030/4544 |access-date=2016-08-11 |quote=These commenced with the production of a short documentary film "The Heimaey Eruption: Iceland 1973" for the CBC program ''The Nature of Things'' (October 1974), and continue today. |archive-date=2016-09-11 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20160911163928/https://journals.lib.unb.ca/index.php/GC/article/viewFile/4030/4544 |url-status=live }}</ref>}}

{{#invoke:Episode list|list|Title=Traveller From An Antique Land |OriginalAirDate= {{Start date|1974|11|06}} |ProdCode=04 |ShortSummary=
