{{#invoke:Episode list|list|Title=The Invisible Reef|OriginalAirDate={{Start date|1976|12|29}} |ProdCode=02 |ShortSummary=
:Through the use of micro-photography, viewers are afforded a look at the unique way in which a reef is formed through a complex system of natural recycling.<ref>{{#invoke:cite|news|url=https://news.google.com/newspapers?id=LpYuAAAAIBAJ&pg=2542%2C2220303 |title=TV Times |work=The Montreal Gazette |date=December 24, 1976 |page=21 |access-date=October 5, 2020 |archive-date=October 23, 2023 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231023123700/https://news.google.com/newspapers?id=LpYuAAAAIBAJ&pg=2542,2220303 |url-status=live }}</ref><ref>{{#invoke:cite|news|url=https://www.newspapers.com/newspage/98262752/ |title=The TV Book |work=Detroit Free Press |date=January 2, 1977 |page=24 |access-date=August 17, 2016 |archive-date=August 27, 2016 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20160827040656/https://www.newspapers.com/newspage/98262752/ |url-status=live }}</ref><!-- Repeat episode of 01/02/1977 cited to provide program description; title is the same -->}}

