{{#invoke:Episode list|list|Title=Children of the Buffalo|OriginalAirDate={{Start date|1977|01|19}} |ProdCode=05 |ShortSummary=
:A study of the [[Todos people|Todos]] tribe of India, their polyandrous marriage rituals and their unusual funeral rites. The Todos spend their lives tending the buffalo and everything they do revolves around this animal.<ref>{{#invoke:cite|news|url=https://www.newspapers.com/newspage/68676318/ |title=TV Week |work=The Brandon Sun |location=Brandon, Manitoba |date=January 14, 1977 |page=10 |access-date=August 18, 2016 |archive-date=August 27, 2016 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20160827083702/https://www.newspapers.com/newspage/68676318/ |url-status=live }}</ref>}}

{{#invoke:Episode list|list|Title=The Gabra|OriginalAirDate={{Start date|1977|01|23}} |ProdCode=special |ShortSummary=
:The [[Gabra people|Gabra]] is a tribe of 24,000 people who live in the harsh terrain on both sides of the Kenya-Ethiopia border. They may be the only non-Muslim, camel raising society left in the world. Their lifestyle is cruel, filled with age-old rituals and beliefs.<ref>{{#invoke:cite|news|last=Peacock |first=Bruce |url=https://news.google.com/newspapers?id=HE5VAAAAIBAJ&pg=2227%2C1492599 |title=Tube Talk |work=The Leader-Post |location=Regina, Saskatchewan |date=January 21, 1977 |page=3, PostScript section |access-date=October 5, 2020 |archive-date=October 23, 2023 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231023123659/https://news.google.com/newspapers?id=HE5VAAAAIBAJ&pg=2227,1492599 |url-status=live }}</ref>}}

{{#invoke:Episode list|list|Title=The Last of Life|OriginalAirDate={{Start date|1977|01|26}} |ProdCode=06 |ShortSummary=
