:The phenomenon of man's changing concepts of the world is explored in relation to his desire to measure time more accurately.<ref>{{#invoke:cite|news|url=https://news.google.com/newspapers?id=7YFVAAAAIBAJ&pg=2114%2C4716930 |title=Television |work=The Leader-Post |location=Regina, Saskatchewan |date=September 29, 1978 |page=4 |access-date=October 5, 2020 |archive-date=October 23, 2023 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231023123647/https://news.google.com/newspapers?id=7YFVAAAAIBAJ&pg=2114,4716930 |url-status=live }}</ref>}}

