:The current efforts in both the United States and Canada to harness the sun as a major resource of heat and power are examined.<ref>{{#invoke:cite|news|url=https://news.google.com/newspapers?id=zl5VAAAAIBAJ&pg=4102%2C1138908 |title=Television |work=The Leader-Post |location=Regina, Saskatchewan |date=November 3, 1978 |page=4 |access-date=October 5, 2020 |archive-date=October 23, 2023 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231023123707/https://news.google.com/newspapers?id=zl5VAAAAIBAJ&pg=4102,1138908 |url-status=live }}</ref>}}

