{{#invoke:Episode list|list|Title=Memories From Eden|OriginalAirDate={{Start date|1980|01|02}} |ProdCode=11 |ShortSummary=
:Special environments which zoo officials have created for the welfare of certain animals and the enjoyment of visitors are highlighted.<ref>{{#invoke:cite|news|url=https://news.google.com/newspapers?id=VJEjAAAAIBAJ&pg=3440%2C3201584 |title=TV Times |work=The Montreal Gazette |date=December 29, 1979 |page=23 |access-date=October 5, 2020 |archive-date=October 23, 2023 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20231023123655/https://news.google.com/newspapers?id=VJEjAAAAIBAJ&pg=3440,3201584 |url-status=live }}</ref>}}

