:Subjects covered include a community for crocodiles, high-altitude physiology and magnetic bacteria.<ref>{{#invoke:cite|news|url=https://news.google.com/newspapers?id=nQVlAAAAIBAJ&sjid=e4MNAAAAIBAJ&pg=6142%2C2399652 |title=TV Times |work=Edmonton Journal |date=January 4, 1980 |page=40}}</ref>}}
