{{#invoke:Episode list|list|Title=Five Seasons|OriginalAirDate={{Start date|2005|07|14}} |ProdCode=19 |ShortSummary=
:The [[Numurindi]] people from Australia's South East [[Arnemland]] have developed a culture where all things past and present, including the weather, are interrelated. This relationship extends to the animal kingdom and plant life, as well as previous generations. Five Seasons explores this delicate relationship through the eyes of the Numurindi people who enjoy the benefits of the modern world, yet are still guided by the seasons and the traditions of the past.<ref>{{#invoke:cite|web|url=https://curio.ca/en/video/five-seasons-1303/ |title=Five Seasons |work=CBC/Radio-Canada |access-date=2016-05-20}}</ref>}}

