{{#invoke:Episode list|list|Title=Decoding Desire|OriginalAirDate={{Start date|2014|11|06}} |ProdCode=05 |ShortSummary=
:Scientists are increasingly looking at animals to reveal more about our own sexual behaviour. Explore how [[sexual diversity]] and the experience of pleasure itself may be the key to species survival.<ref>{{#invoke:cite|web|url=http://www.cbc.ca/natureofthings/episodes/decoding-desire |title=Decoding Desire |work=CBC/Radio-Canada |url-status = live|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20141022232834/http://www.cbc.ca/natureofthings/episodes/decoding-desire |archive-date=2014-10-22 |access-date=2016-04-21}}</ref>}}

{{#invoke:Episode list|list|Title=Chasing Snowflakes|OriginalAirDate={{Start date|2014|11|13}} |ProdCode=06 |ShortSummary=
